        <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl text-white drop-shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(255,255,255,0.8)] tracking-widest relative z-10">
            <span class="text-[#0055A4]">건</span>.<span class="text-[#FBD304]">프</span>.<span class="text-[#EF4135]">사</span> <span class="text-[#4B5320]">럭키</span><span class="text-[#B71C1C]">드로우</span>
