                <div class="flex justify-between items-end mb-3">
                    <h2 class="text-2xl text-[#FF007F] tracking-widest">파일럿 명단</h2>
                    <span class="text-sm bg-[#111] text-[#FF007F] border border-[#FF007F] px-3 py-1 font-sans">
